  "notes": "Elemental Magic Arena is a PvP fighting game made by anton25131. You choose an element in the lobby, such as fire, water, ice or lightning, then walk into the arena and battle other players with its spells. Diamonds hidden around the arena unlock new elements, secret elements can drop while you fight, and a fresh element is added every week.\n\nCodes give Souls or Diamonds, which you use to unlock elements and power up your magic. Diamonds are the handiest early, because more elements means more ways to fight. Most codes are like-goal rewards named after the like count, like 150KLIKES, so a new one tends to appear each time the game gains another 10,000 likes. The newest codes are also shown on the board in the lobby codes area.",
